[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i84"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我带着Hydro Caliber零式，来到了村公所。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11728"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你来了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“今天也要去巡逻吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把野美希手工制作的袖章从口袋里拿了出来。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11709"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不，今天的任务是监视。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“监视？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11829"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“对，从那里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看向野美希指着的地方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那里是广播塔。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，就是你平时上去的那里啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11826"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“那我去上面瞭望了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说完，野美希立刻就准备自己一个人爬到广播塔上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等一下，那我呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11829"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你在下面守着，等待我的指示。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11837"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“兵分两路的话，出现紧急情况的时候就能更快行动了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这倒是没错，可是。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我也想爬上去看看。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i508"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"抬头仰望塔顶。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从正下方望上去，这座塔看起来相当高。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好像很有意思。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11708"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“上面的瞭望台很挤的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不够上两个人的吗？”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i84"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11699"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“倒也不会不够……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11701"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不过会和我靠得很近哦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原来如此。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“感觉有点太刺激了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11869"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“那就放弃吧。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i158"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"野美希说完，就独自爬上了梯子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"动作很娴熟，爬得十分顺畅。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真厉害啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的视线不由自主地追逐她的身影。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好像能看得到她裙子里面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为她爬到了一个高于我视线的位置，理所当然会这样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"当然，我一点都没有想要偷看。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是不小心看到了而已。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“野美希！停一下！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11836"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你再继续往上爬的话……那个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“会看见……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11836"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“看见什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“裙子……里面。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这话刚说出口，我的脸就变通红了。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我穿着安全裤呢，没问题的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，这样啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"原来并不会看到内裤啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦？是这样的吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“有什么好害羞的？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11857"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“又不是能看到内衣。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是……这样吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11828"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“毕竟少年团的工作经常要跑来跑去。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11825"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“所以，我一直都很小心的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道是我过度在意了吗？"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11836"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“失望了吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没、没有！绝对没有！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"吓了我一跳，感觉自己的想法被看穿了一样。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11833"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“那么，就拜托你在下面看守了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说完，她又继续顺着梯子往上爬。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"裙子爬升到了视线上方更高的位置。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"能看到的安全裤面积越来越大……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从大腿……到臀、臀部的曲线――……"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"继续看","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"移开视线","value":1,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":162,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然野美希说没问题……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但现在我看到的，可是少年团治安维持执行部队长大人的裙底。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然没有看到内裤，但确确实实是裙底。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这……岂不是很了不得的事吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"毕竟那可是裙底啊？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“野美希。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11836"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“还有什么事吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我姑且想问你一下。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“既然不是内衣，被看到你也不会觉得害羞。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那就是说我可以继续看，对吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不自觉地说话都变礼貌了。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11730"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我倒是无所谓，你想看吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11698"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你还真是好奇心旺盛啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为是裙底嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11733"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“……什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“虽然不是内裤，但是裙底已经足以……让人心跳加速。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11711"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“……鹰原，你这家伙……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为你说没问题……我就觉得可以嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11723"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“……随、随你便。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的可以随我便吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11849"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“没、没关系。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"得到了她的许可。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i342"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":512,"image":"i25637"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"既然如此，那我就恭敬不如从命，堂堂正正地继续看下去了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喔，原来如此……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11711"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你、你在感叹什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没什么，只是觉得安全裤……真不错啊。”"},{"op":"goto","target":239},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"现在，我看到的是紧贴在皮肤上，具有弹性的一块薄布。"},{"op":"goto","target":243},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这就意味着……比内裤还要接近裸体……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊……不行了……这已经超出了男高中生的极限。"},{"op":"goto","target":245},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不不不、不行了！不行！我看着都觉得害羞！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11700"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“那、那就别看！给……给我低下头去！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好、好的！”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":256},{"op":"clear","layer":512},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我猛地把视线转向地面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还把眼睛也闭上了。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i84"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"goto","target":219},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不行！再看下去我就受不了了！"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"闭着眼睛低下头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"野美希似乎没有注意到这样的我，继续有节奏地爬着梯子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔……呜呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"传来一股想要睁开眼睛的冲动。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一股想要抬起头来的冲动。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是我不可以。这样才对得起野美希的信任。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咦？不过野美希这会儿正在爬梯子，应该是看不到我的吧？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那我偷偷看一下大概也不会被发现……？"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i84"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“鹰原羽依里――!!”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11717"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“怎、怎么了؟!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“别在意。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“只是在给自己打气而已。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“比起这个，快、快点……爬上去吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11730"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“为什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“裙、裙底很让我在意！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11708"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不是说了是安全裤所以没问题吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对我来说有问题啊！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11698"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“有什么问题？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那可是女孩子的裙底啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11717"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“根本无所谓是安全裤还是内裤。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11723"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“……～～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对我来说……太、太过刺激了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11849"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“～～～～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……野美希？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11700"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“别、别看啊!؟你不准往上看！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11700"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“绝对不准往上看！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"（这是暗示让我看的意思吗？）"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11700"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“偷窥女生裙底是非常不检点的行为！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11720"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不、不可以做这种事情！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11723"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不行的哦，嗯，不行！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"（……她的词汇量要见底了。）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来是真的慌了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，野美希这样害羞的声音倒是很新鲜。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的心跳又不禁加快了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"过了一会儿，咚、咚……传来了野美希爬梯子的声音。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"与一开始相比，她的动作带上了几分犹豫。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我有这样的感觉。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11849"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"或许是因为野美希知道了我很在意她，在她爬到塔顶之后，我也总感觉她有在意着我这边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11849"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"于是，我们一整天就这样奇怪地在意着彼此，继续进行着治安维持活动。"},{"op":"set","variable":420,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11846"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“天哪，居然会对安全裤感到兴奋，原来你是个变态啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“安全裤吗……”"},{"op":"goto","target":139},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说不定它比内裤还要薄。"},{"op":"goto","target":141},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“大、大大、大腿腿还有屁、屁股的形状，都、都看得一一一、清二楚。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11849"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你、你这家伙，表现得这、这么慌乱的话，连我、我也要……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"被我的慌乱所感染，野美希也开始语无伦次。"},{"op":"goto","target":144},{"op":"end"}]